commit a339671db64b ("vdso: Switch get/put_unaligned() from packed struct to
memcpy()"), which landed in 7.0, causes a performance regression on an NXP
i.MX25 (ARMv5TE) SoC.

Revert vdso: Switch get/put_unaligned() from packed struct to memcpy()
https://github.com/CachyOS/linux/commit/a339671db64b

diff --git a/include/vdso/unaligned.h b/include/vdso/unaligned.h
index ff0c06b6513eff..9076483c9fbbd0 100644
--- a/include/vdso/unaligned.h
+++ b/include/vdso/unaligned.h
@@ -2,43 +2,14 @@
